Blockquote lazy continuation

```
> quoted
continued
.
<blockquote><p>quoted
continued</p></blockquote>
```

```
> quoted
- item
.
<blockquote><p>quoted
- item</p></blockquote>
```

```
> # h
- item
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="h">h</h1>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>item</li>
</ul>
```

```
> # h
b
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="h">h</h1>
</blockquote>
<p>b</p>
```

```
> :: t
~
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
<p>~</p>
```

```
> [f]: ~
/
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>/</p>
```
